/// `FA_PROVIDER_TYPE` + `FA_PROVIDER_NAME` + `FA_PROVIDER_CONFIG` (a JSON
/// object with required `baseUrl`/`model` and an optional `apiKeyEnvVar`)
/// plus the key env var the config references. Every text input has a
